WEBVTT

00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:07.301
This video shows how to link a staff member to an existing user account on your phone, and how to unlink it again.

00:00:08.974 --> 00:00:22.654
Tap the menu button at the top left, open HR & Staff, and choose Staff Directory. In the search box, type Hina. The card for Hina Malik shows No account, so there is no login yet.

00:00:26.241 --> 00:00:31.953
Tap Link Account on the card to connect the staff member to a user that already exists.

00:00:34.668 --> 00:00:42.060
Type part of the name or username in the search box, here accountant. The matching users appear below.

00:00:44.726 --> 00:00:52.310
Tap the right user. A message says the account was linked, and the username now shows on the staff card.

00:00:55.435 --> 00:01:01.579
To remove the link, tap Unlink on the card. A box asks you to confirm.

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:11.904
Tap Unlink to confirm. A message says the account was unlinked. The user account is not deleted, only the link is removed.

00:01:14.736 --> 00:01:18.840
The link is removed, and the card shows No account again.
